        0\longrightarrow \omega_X^{GR}(h)\otimes\mathcal{O}_X(L)\hookrightarrow\mathscr{L}^{n,0}_{L,h}\overset{\overline{\partial}}{\longrightarrow}\mathscr{L}^{n,1}_{L,h}\overset{\overline{\partial}}{\longrightarrow}\mathscr{L}^{n,2}_{L,h}\overset{\overline{\partial}}{\longrightarrow}\cdots
