 and preliminary results in $X^1(\mathbb{R}^N)$; giving a variational construction of Cerami sequences; establishing a new profile decomposition adapted to $X^1(\mathbb{R}^N)$; and finally proving strong convergence of the Cerami sequence and verifying that its limit is a ground state.

