\begin{proposition}\label{trivial_noise}
Let $\alpha=1$, $\H\in\left(\tfrac{1}{3},\tfrac{1}{2}\right)$, and let the initial data $u_0^{\epsilon}$ and $v_0^{\epsilon}$ be divergence-free, of zero mean, and satisfy
