The first main result of this paper is as follows.

\begin{equation}\label{eq0}
\begin{cases}
-\epsilon^{2}\Delta u +P(x) u= \mu_1 u^3  +\beta uv^2,
&~\text{in}\;\mathbb R^3,\\
\noalign{\vskip1truemm} -\epsilon^{2}\Delta v+Q(x) v= \mu_2 v^3 +\beta
u^2v, &~\text{in}\;\mathbb R^3,
\end{cases}
\end{equation}

