ref_dict.TM-subcritiche:
\begin{lem}\label{TM-subcritiche}
		Under \eqref{BM} or \eqref{nonBM}, condition $(H_3)$ implies that for all $p>0$ one has
        $$\lim_{t\to+\infty}\frac{f(t)}{t^p}=+\infty=\lim_{t\to+\infty}\frac{g(t)}{t^p}$$
