\begin{problem}[\cite{Cho}]\label{problem:Cho}
    For $\eta  \leq  \theta$, give a new definition of the plactic skew Schur $P$-function $\sPlacticSchur_{\theta/\eta}$
 so that it belongs to the ring generated by plactic Schur $P$-functions and it describes
the multiplicities of the ordinary $P_\lambda$ in the expansion of $P_{\theta/\eta}$ in a nice way.
\end{problem}

