Let $x_1,\ldots,x_r$ be roots of unity and $a\in \mathbb{C}\setminus \mathbb{Z}$. For $\bfk=(k_1,\ldots,k_r)\in \mathbb{N}^r$ and $(k_1,x_1),\ (k_r,x_r)\neq (1,1)$, we have
