\begin{remark} \label{rmk: JKP}
Let $C : y^2 = f(x)$ be a twist of $C_0$ and let $\gamma_k$ be zeros of $f$.
Then a $\overline{\bQ}$-isomorphism $\phi$ from $C$ to $C_0$ satisfies that
