Recall Whipple's ${}_5F_4$ formula (cf. \cite{Whipple1926})
\begin{align}\label{Whipple}
&\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{(a)_k(1+\frac{a}{2})_k(b)_k(c)_k(d)_k}{(1)_k(\frac a2)_k(1+a-b)_k(1+a-c)_k(1+a-d)_k}\notag\\
&\qquad=\frac{\Gamma(1+a-b)\Gamma(1+a-c)\Gamma(1+a-d)\Gamma(1+a-b-c-d)}{\Gamma(1+a)\Gamma(1+a-b-c)\Gamma(1+a-b-d)\Gamma(1+a-c-d)}.
\end{align}
