\end{aligned}
\end{equation}
Therefore, we have $q=O(\varepsilon_1)$ and $p=O(\varepsilon_1^{3/2})$, and thus $|(q,p)|=O(\varepsilon_1)$ and $|(q,p,\varepsilon_1)|=O(\varepsilon_1)$, and by \eqref{eq:r-estimate} we obtain
