    Let $N$ be large, $\alpha>\frac{1}{2}$, and let $N\geq H=H(N)\geq N^{\frac{4\alpha + 1}{5}}$. The number of square-free integers in the short interval $(N-H, N]$ such that $P^+(n)>N^{\alpha}$ is 
