             \int_0^t \int_{\mathbb{T}^3_x} \frac{1}{2}\mu \sigma(\tilde{\u}_{\varepsilon}-\u^b_{\varepsilon}):\sigma(\tilde{\u}_{\varepsilon}-\u^b_{\varepsilon}) + \frac{5}{2}  \kappa(\nabla_x \tilde{\theta} -\nabla_x \theta^b_{\varepsilon})^2 \ dxds \lesssim \frac{1}{\varepsilon^2} H(f_{\varepsilon}^{\mathrm{in}}|M_{\varepsilon}^{\mathrm{in}}) + \mathcal{O}(\varepsilon),
