For any $1 \leq r \leq 3$, the vector $(h^{GW}_{r,c_1}(\tau))_{-r< c_1 \leq 0}$, with components the log Gromov--Witten generating series of $(Y,D)$ given in \eqref{Eq:log GW generating}, is a vector-valued mock modular form of weight $-\frac{3}{2}$ and depth $r$.
\end{corollary}

