In dimension $d=2$, can one replace the remainder $\sqrt{\frac{\log n}{n}}$ in \eqref{eq:Steinerberger2D}
by $\frac{1}{\sqrt n}$ while keeping the same off-diagonal Green term? In other terms, does there exist
