$$\|f\|_{H\left(\mathbb{B}^n\right)}=\left(\int_{\mathbb{B}^n}P_k\left(f\right)fdV-\prod_{i=1}^{k}\frac{\left(2i-1\right)^2}{4}\int_{\mathbb{B}^n}|f|^2dV\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}.$$

It is noted that $\|f\|_{H\left(\mathbb{B}^n\right)}$ is indeed a norm by using the Poincare-Sobolev inequality.

\begin{equation}\label{BPS}
\int_{\mathbb{B}^n}P_k\left(f\right)fdV-\prod_{i=1}^{k}\frac{\left(2i-1\right)^2}{4}\int_{\mathbb{B}^n}|f|^2dV\geq C_{n,k,p}\left(\int_{\mathbb{B}^n}|f|^{p}dV\right)^{\frac{2}{p}},
\end{equation}

