Given a finite graph $\Gamma$, we have a family $\{G_v\}_{v\in V(\Gamma)}$ of groups satisfying Haagerup property and associated Haagerup tuples $\{(G_v,\phi_v,\mathcal{H}_v,R_v)\}_{v\in V(\Gamma)}$. We follow similar approach as above to prove theorem \ref{main theorem} for the graph product $G(\Gamma)$.\\

